.TH SDL_WINDOWPOS_CENTERED_DISPLAY 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_WINDOWPOS_CENTERED_DISPLAY \- Used to indicate that the window position should be centered.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_video.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_WINDOWPOS_CENTERED_DISPLAY(X)  (SDL_WINDOWPOS_CENTERED_MASK|(X))
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION

.BR SDL_WINDOWPOS_CENTERED
is the same, but always uses the primary display instead of specifying one\[char46]

.SH MACRO PARAMETERS
.TP
.I X
the
.BR SDL_DisplayID
of the display to use\[char46]
.SH AVAILABILITY
This macro is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

